# NPM Ignore
# Files to exclude from the NPM package to keep it lightweight.

# Archives & Internal/Obsolete Docs
_archs/
docs/studies/
docs/issues/
docs/vision/
# But keep docs/technical and docs/images!

# Development/Analysis
ANALYSIS_REPORT.md
AGENT.md
ROADMAP.md

# Logs & Temp files
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.gencodedoc/
.gencodedoc.yaml
.npmrc
opencode-pollinations-plugin_tree_code.md

# Source (we ship compiled dist/)
# We usually ship src/ for debugging, but if you want lean package exclude it.
# Keeping src/ for now as per v5.9.

# Tests
tests/
test/
__tests__/

# Editor Configs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
